AI BUG HUNTER
│
├── 0. INITIALIZATION & STATE RECOVERY
│   ├── Read previous findings and task board
│   ├── Recover useful evidence and unfinished tasks
│   ├── Verify real tools, MCP schemas, and permissions
│   └── Establish completion criteria
│
├── 1. ROOT DOMAIN & SCOPE
│   ├── Verify official program policy
│   ├── Passive root-domain reconnaissance
│   ├── Certificate Transparency / DNS / Wayback
│   ├── Discover and deduplicate child hostnames
│   └── Scope gate for EACH hostname
│       ├── IN_SCOPE_CONFIRMED → Continue
│       ├── SCOPE_UNVERIFIED → Passive research only
│       └── OUT_OF_SCOPE → Exclude
│
├── 2. PER-HOST ASSESSMENT LOOP
│   ├── Reconnaissance
│   ├── Routes / APIs / Forms / JavaScript
│   ├── Application architecture
│   ├── Threat model and trust boundaries
│   ├── Root-cause hypothesis
│   ├── Minimal controlled test
│   ├── Actual tool execution
│   ├── Evidence and negative controls
│   └── Finding disposition
│
├── 3. ARCHITECTURE-DRIVEN TEST BRANCHES
│   ├── Identity / Authentication / Sessions
│   ├── Authorization / IDOR / Multi-tenancy
│   ├── Injection / XSS / Template Processing
│   ├── APIs / GraphQL / WebSockets
│   ├── SSRF / Files / Deserialization
│   ├── CORS / CSRF / Browser Security
│   ├── HTTP / Caching / Redirects
│   ├── Business Logic / Workflow / Race Conditions
│   ├── Cloud / Configuration / Dependencies
│   └── AI/LLM Security — only if applicable
│
├── 4. EXECUTION & ORCHESTRATION
│   ├── Browser MCP / Playwright
│   ├── Burp MCP / permitted scanning
│   ├── CLI / source analysis
│   ├── Parallel specialized subagents
│   └── Recovery from timeouts and write failures
│
├── 5. VALIDATION
│   ├── Reproduce actual behavior
│   ├── Verify security-boundary violation
│   ├── Demonstrate meaningful impact
│   ├── Eliminate alternative explanations
│   └── Independent review where practical
│
└── 6. COMPLETION GATE
    ├── Evidence-backed findings
    ├── Rejected / blocked / untested hypotheses
    ├── Verified artifacts
    ├── Consistent task board and logs
    └── Honest final report
